  "fwm.tutorial.intro": "Hey, I am HydraVB. Let me show you what is in here.",
  "fwm.tutorial.picker": "What do you want?",
  "fwm.tutorial.keys": "Three keys to know: %s opens this menu, %s toggles the sell macro, %s jumps to your messages.",
  "fwm.tutorial.overview": "Your start screen: every tile is a feature, sorted into Trading, Chat, Tools and Streamer Tools. Right-click a tile to switch that feature on or off.",
  "fwm.tutorial.sellmacro": "I sell for you until you press the key again. Under \"Open settings\", \"Default [Optimal]\" sets the best timings.",
  "fwm.tutorial.items": "First things first: tell me under Items what may be sold. The list ships empty, and empty means I sell nothing at all.",
  "fwm.tutorial.stats": "I read the server's sale messages out of the chat: earnings, items, per hour and the last 24 hours show up here on their own.",
  "fwm.tutorial.tests": "One click on Minute test, wait 60 seconds. Then you know what your farm makes per hour, and can scale it to any sell multiplier.",
  "fwm.tutorial.messages": "Your private messages as a real messenger with history. TPA and TPAHere go straight from the chat, after a quick question.",
  "fwm.tutorial.toolguard": "I stop your mining before the pickaxe breaks. The swing never goes out. Your weapon in a fight I leave alone.",
  "fwm.tutorial.secondchat": "A second small chat window for what matters: private messages, TPAs, payments, clan chat.",
  "fwm.tutorial.spawner": "FWM's current prices for every spawner. \"Buy / Sell\" opens a ticket right from the game. You get the key for it once in the Discord.",
  "fwm.tutorial.members": "The real clan list by rank. The FWM logo floats above every real member in game, your protection against fakes.",
  "fwm.tutorial.settings": "Colours, menu size, language and keys. In a moment I will show you the overlay editor too.",
  "fwm.tutorial.overlay": "My in-game cards. Drag them where you want them. Pull a corner to resize, R resets.",
  "fwm.tutorial.done": "That's it. The i next to your name shows giveaways, infos, bugs and fixes / updates. Next to Settings at the bottom you can restart the tour any time. Have fun!",
  "fwm.tutorial.hud.macro": "while selling",
